PopClaw public contract candidate — public-envelope-01

This candidate contains PopClaw protocol source, generated bindings, a schema
descriptor, test vectors, tests, and implementation documentation.

Third-party components retain their respective licenses. TypeScript bindings
are generated with protobufjs-cli 1.1.3 and protobufjs 7.6.6. Rust bindings use
prost-build 0.13.5. The schema descriptor is generated with protoc 34.1.

External dependency packages and environments are not bundled in this source
candidate. See THIRD-PARTY.md and third-party-licenses/ for component attribution,
retained upstream license and notice texts, and the scope of this archive.
